9,Kpelle (guerze) people: liberia`s largest tribe and a hardworking and...,https://kwekudee-tripdownmemorylane.blogspot.com/2013/07/kpelle-guerze-people-liberias-largest.html,"The Kpelle people also known as the Guerze, Kpwesi, Kpessi, Gerse, Mpessi, Berlu, Gbelle, Bere, Gbalin, Gizima, or Bun are a hard working and very humble Mande-speaking people of larger Niger Congo family living in the West African countries of Liberia and Guinea.",Kpessi,Niger-Congo
